BATCHING EXAMPLE 1: (Lets take a few orders and try to understand the Batching Logic concept). Consider these orders are assigned to same machine and same operation.

| Priority no (Lower the CDD, Higher the Priority) | SIZE | CLASS | MOC | DESIGN | QTY | FIXTURE ID | LOCATOR ID |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| 2 | 10 | 150 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 5 | A | 1 |
| 1 | 10 | 300 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 4 | A | 2 |
| 3 | 8 | 150 | Stainless Steel | LUG | 10 | A | 3 |
| 5 | 12 | 150 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 10 | A | 4 |
| 4 | 10 | 150 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 21 | A | 1 |

Here in this case how would you process or Prioritize the orders., It is simple :

| 1 | 10 | 300 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 4 | A | 2 | - This will the first order to be pipelined because this it has high priority., Now this is where Batching logic starts., In the order list (in our case WIP), look for similae SIZE~CLASS~MOC~DESIGN with same fixture an locator for same machine and operation (in this case 10~300~CS~DF), we dont have any. So we look for same Fixture, Locator combo in order list (A, 2) we dont have any. So we look for same Fixture but different Locator with higher priority for next micro batch.
| 2 | 10 | 150 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 5 | A | 1 | - This will be the second order to be pipelined and first order to be batched with previous order due to higher priority and similar fixture but only different locator. In this atomic batching, now look for same SIZE~CLASS~MOC~DESIGN, we have one order. So combine that in this atomic batch.
| 4 | 10 | 150 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 21 | A | 1 | - This will be the third order to be pipelined and second order to be batched with previous orders due to same SIZE~CLASS~MOC~DESIGN similarity. now again look for same SIZE~CLASS~MOC~DESIGN, we dont have any. So look for same Fixture, Locator combo (A, 1), we dont have any so now go to same Fixture but different locator combo with higher priority.
| 3 | 8 | 150 | Stainless Steel | LUG | 10 | A | 3 | - This will be the fourth order to be pipelined and third order to be batched with previous orders due to higher priority and similar fixture but only different locator. So now look for same SIZE~CLASS~MOC~DESIGN, we dont have any so go for Fixture, Locator combo (A, 3), we dont have any. So now go for same fixture but different locator combo.
| 5 | 12 | 150 | Carbon Steel | DFS | 10 | A | 4 | - This will be the Fifth order to pipeline and last order to be batched with previous orders due to higher priority and similar fixture but only different locator.

